/* Bovitech Super App — v2.45: records and billing (from the ezyVet walkthrough).
   • Case owner on the record (the vet in charge — from the appointment, can be changed).
   • Which vet did each procedure: one vet on the record → all theirs; several → each procedure says which vet, or shared (split %).
     Every invoice line carries its vet(s), so income can be totalled by vet later.
   • Applies to: the whole herd / a mob (description, head) / one animal (tag, brand, age, use, sex, class, colour, breed, optional
     assessment). Printed at the top of the procedure. The same tag again on the same business → offer to fill in and link the records.
   • Invoices: discount a line or the whole invoice ($ or %); take a discount rule off; rules can also put a price up; PO number (and
     "always needs a PO number" per business — asked for before approving); opening line from the record and message lines;
     🖨️ Printed and posted; ↩ Undo sent.
   • Set-up fee charged once for consecutive days with the same client (no other appointment in between).
   • 📆 Several days: an appointment that runs over several days (each day its own times, record, appointment fee and travel).
   • Appointments missing a record or an invoice (Records list + Scheduling job, after go-live). 🚀 Go-live date in Settings.
   • Admin jobs to check each of these. */
